<!-- HE0 (plan HE1 Task 4): OpenPanel 2.3.0's migration 14 creates an
     AggregatingMergeTree with a column outside its sorting key, which
     ClickHouse 26.7 and later refuse unless this MergeTree setting is on
     (Umami hits the same check, HE1 R0.6). The application is run unmodified,
     so the server takes the setting; the incompatibility is a mining finding. -->
<clickhouse>
    <merge_tree>
        <allow_dimensions_outside_sorting_key>1</allow_dimensions_outside_sorting_key>
    </merge_tree>
</clickhouse>
